From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: metaX contributors
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] javbus: validate detail URL origin and path

Reject non-HTTPS URLs, unexpected hosts/ports, userinfo, and non-detail
paths before the provider derives an ID or fetches the page. Keep support
for both root-level and /ja/{id} detail paths used by JavBus.

Add deterministic URL parsing tests. This patch is based on
metatube-community/metatube-sdk-go commit
c62584675c593816cc07e7b5b977d14c7eb505a3.

